s.\n1442\t\n1443\tIn Interspeech,\n1444\t\n1445\tCited by: §4.1.\n1446\t\n1447\t[19]\n1448\tC. D. Kim, B. Kim, H. Lee, and G. Kim (2019)\n1449\t\n1450\tAudioCaps: generating captions for audios in the wild.\n1451\t\n1452\tIn Proceedings of the Conference of the North American Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics (NAACL),\n1453\t\n1454\tCited by: §4.1,\n1455\t§6.\n1456\t\n1457\t[20]\n1458\tJ. Kim, J. Kong, and J. Son (2021)\n1459\t\n1460\tConditional variational autoencoder with adversarial learning for end-to-end text-to-speech.\n1461\t\n1462\tIn International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML),\n1463\t\n1464\tCited by: §2.1.\n1465\t\n1466\t[21]\n1467\tS. Lee, J. Chung, Y. Yu, G. Kim, T. Breuel, G. Chechik, and Y. Song (2021)\n1468\t\n1469\tAcav100m: automatic curation of large-scale datasets for audio-visual video representation learning.\n1470\t\n1471\tIn Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision,\n1472\t\n1473\tpp. 10274–10284.\n1474\t\n1475\tCited by: §4.1.\n1476\t\n1477\t[22]\n1478\tP. Li, B. Chen, Y. Li, and Y. Li (2023)\n1479\t\n1480\tJEN-1: text-guided universal music generation with omnidirectional diffusion models.\n1481\t\n1482\tarXiv preprint arXiv:2308.04729.\n1483\t\n1484\tCited by: §2.1.\n1485\t\n1486\t[23]\n1487\tY. Lipman, R. T. Q. Chen, H. Ben-Hamu, M. Nicklas, M. Le, M. Esmaeilpour, and A. Grover (2022)\n1488\t\n1489\tFlow matching for generative modeling.\n1490\t\n1491\tarXiv preprint arXiv:2210.02747.\n1492\t\n1493\tCited by: §2.1.\n1494\t\n1495\t[24]\n1496\tH. Liu, Z. Chen, Y. Yuan, X. Mei, X. Liu, D. Mandic, W. Wang, and M. D. Plumbley (2023)\n1497\t\n1498\tAudioLDM: text-to-audio generation with latent diffusion models.\n1499\t\n1500\tIn International Conference on Machine Learning (ICML),\n1501\t\n1502\tCited by: §1,\n1503\t§2.1,\n1504\t§4.1.\n1505\t\n1506\t[25]\n1507\tH. Liu, Y. Yuan, X. Liu, X. Mei, Q. Kong, Q. Tian, Y. Wang, W. Wang, Y. Wang, and M. D. Plumbley (2023)\n1508\t\n1509\tAud